And then there is the second volume,

589
00:20:03,520 --> 00:20:04,700
which is called the privileged instructions.

590
00:20:04,700 --> 00:20:06,760
Neither of them is very big.

591
00:20:06,760 --> 00:20:08,840
For the unprivileged instructions,

592
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:10,740
it's probably only around 200 pages,

593
00:20:10,740 --> 00:20:12,040
around 200 pages.

594
00:20:12,040 --> 00:20:12,800
If you...

595
00:20:12,800 --> 00:20:14,280
you probably don't have that concept yet,

