00:20:14,280 --> 00:20:15,780
but if you're interested later on,

597
00:20:15,780 --> 00:20:17,400
and take a look at the ARM manual,

598
00:20:17,400 --> 00:20:19,080
you'll realize that 200 pages

599
00:20:19,080 --> 00:20:20,640
is actually a very small number.

